Adds --prepare-env to Altinity/clickhouse-regression: it builds and pulls the
images a suite runs, then stops without running tests.

From https://github.com/Altinity/clickhouse-regression/pull/170, made against
commit 5f7decbac4a3896931be5cfe1882ab1ad1e72fab of main. Like the suite it
patches, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Apply it from the root of a checkout of that commit:

    git apply prepare-env.patch

